# Allow only files required by the runnable solution.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements.lock.txt
!solution/
solution/**
!solution/*.py
!solution/prompts/
solution/prompts/**
!solution/prompts/*.md
!src/
src/**
!src/common.py
# Keep credentials and bytecode excluded even beneath an allowed directory.
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
